[00:18.94]1. How great is the honor, Jehovah,
[00:25.12]To build you a place for your name!
[00:31.32]We offer it now with rejoicing
[00:36.22]To add to your glory and fame.
[00:43.06]Whatever the things we may give you,
[00:49.14]They rightly were yours from the start.
[00:55.22]Our labor, our skill, our possessions,
[01:00.68]We joyfully give from the heart.
[01:06.06](Chorus)
[01:06.44]May we present this place to you,
[01:12.44]And here may your name be known.
[01:18.60]We dedicate this place to you;
[01:25.08]Please accept it as your own.
[01:33.06]2. And now may we honor you, Father,
[01:55.04]By filling this place with your praise.
[02:01.20]May glory ascend with the increase
[02:06.18]Of those who are learning your ways.
[02:13.24]Committing this place to your worship,
[02:19.04]We give it our generous care.
[02:25.48]And long may it stand as a witness,
[02:32.08]Supporting the message we bear.
[02:36.02](Chorus)
[02:36.36]May we present this place to you,
[02:42.34]And here may your name be known.
[02:48.10]We dedicate this place to you;
[02:56.88]Please accept it as your own.
